message: >-
  If you use FLINCH in academic work, please cite this software.
type: software
title: "FLINCH: FLare-INduced CHanges in Sun-as-a-star radial velocities"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
authors:
  - family-names: "García"
    given-names: "Gabriel"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7256-2609"
repository-code: https://github.com/gabgarar/FLINCH
