license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  Response of the Sun seen as a star to solar flares: radial velocities, oscillation power,
  chromospheric indices and line shapes from the NEID solar spectra, cross-matched with the
  GOES flare lists.
keywords:
  - solar physics
  - solar flares
  - radial velocity
  - Sun-as-a-star
  - exoplanets
